# Clinical Trials Co-Pilot — Full System Documentation

## Overview

A web application for clinical research coordinators ("Susan") that automates two major pain points:
1. **Regulatory document management** — tracks expiring/expired documents from Notion, syncs deadlines to Google Calendar
2. **Sponsor report generation** — pulls live trial data from Google Sheets + Notion, fills a Google Docs template, routes it through a PI review/approval workflow, and finalizes by appending the report link to a Google Calendar sponsor call event

