### Sponsor Report Routes (Task #2)

| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/reports` | Lists all reports from Replit DB (newest first) |
| POST | `/reports/generate` | Full generation flow (see below) |
| POST | `/reports/:id/send-to-pi` | Sends PI review email via Gmail, advances Draft → PI Review |
| POST | `/reports/:id/mark-approved` | Advances PI Review → Approved |
| POST | `/reports/:id/mark-final` | Appends report link to Google Calendar event, advances Approved → Sent |
| POST | `/reports/:id/discard` | Deletes Google Doc from Drive, marks Discarded |
| POST | `/internal/nag-check` | Sends nag emails for PI Review reports past nag interval |

