## Sponsor Report Generation Flow

```
POST /reports/generate
│
├── 1. Validate settings (piEmail, googleSheetsId, googleDocsTemplateId required)
│
├── 2. Concurrent guard
│      If a report is already in Draft, PI Review, or Approved status → 409
│
├── 3. Staleness check (Google Drive files.get modifiedTime)
│      If sheet is older than 24h AND acknowledgeStale is not true:
│        → return { requiresStaleAcknowledge: true, stalenessWarning: "..." }
│      (Frontend shows modal; user clicks "Generate Anyway" → retry with acknowledgeStale=true)
│
├── 4. Read enrollment data from Google Sheets
│      Hard error 503 if fails (no silent zero fallback)
│
├── 5. Read AE/deviation/milestone data from Notion
│      Hard error 503 if Notion API fails
│      Zero counts only for genuinely empty databases
│
├── 6. Copy Google Docs template (Drive files.copy)
│      Hard error 503 if fails, no orphan created
│
├── 7. Fill all 11 placeholders (Docs batchUpdate replaceAllText matchCase:true)
│      Hard error 503 if fails → deletes orphaned doc
│
├── 8. Scan for unreplaced {{...}} placeholders (full document tree)
│      Non-fatal: surfaces as warnings in response, not error
│
├── 9. Grant PI writer access (Drive permissions.create)
│      Hard error 503 if fails → deletes orphaned doc
│
├── 10. Save report record to Replit DB (status: Draft)
│
└── 11. Return { report, stalenessWarning, requiresStaleAcknowledge: false }
```

