## Report Lifecycle

```
[Generate]
    │
    ▼
  Draft ──────────────────────────────────────────────────► Discarded
    │                                                        (Drive doc deleted)
    │ [Send to PI]
    │ (Gmail email sent to piEmail)
    ▼
 PI Review ──── [Nag engine fires every nagIntervalHours]
    │
    │ [Mark Approved]
    ▼
 Approved
    │
    │ [Mark Final]
    │ (Appends doc URL to Google Calendar sponsor call event description)
    ▼
  Sent
```

**Status rules:**
- Only one active report (Draft/PI Review/Approved) allowed at a time
- Discard only allowed from Draft
- Mark Final requires `sponsorCallEventId` to be configured in Settings
- All transitions are hard errors on any integration failure (no silent state advancement)

### Report Record Schema (Replit DB)
```typescript
{
  id: string           // UUID
  status: "Draft" | "PI Review" | "Approved" | "Sent" | "Discarded"
  docId: string        // Google Docs file ID
  docUrl: string       // https://docs.google.com/document/d/{docId}/edit
  generatedAt: string  // ISO timestamp
  sentToPiAt?: string
  approvedAt?: string
  finalizedAt?: string
  lastNagAt?: string
  unreplacedPlaceholders: string[]  // any {{...}} left after fill
}
```

**Storage keys:**
- `reports:all` — JSON array of all report IDs (index)
- `report:{uuid}` — individual report record
- `app:settings` — settings object

