## Environment Variables / Secrets

| Variable | Where Set | Required | Description |
|----------|-----------|----------|-------------|
| `NOTION_TOKEN` | Replit Secrets | For seed script only | Notion integration token |
| `STALE_THRESHOLD_HOURS` | Replit Secrets (API server) | No | Override staleness threshold (demo) |
| `NAG_SECRET` | Replit Secrets (API server + scheduled job) | Required in production | Shared secret for nag endpoint auth |
| `NAG_URL` | Replit Secrets (scheduled job) | Required for scheduled job | Full URL to `/api/internal/nag-check` |
| `PORT` | Auto-set by Replit | Yes | Port for each service |

All Google/Notion OAuth tokens are managed automatically by Replit Integrations — no manual token handling needed.

